OL,3,GNEWSAGrant 'fiasco' leaves future
OL,4,Auncertain, says farmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer whose family has worked the
OL,7,Fland in Cambridgeshire for almost 100
OL,8,Fyears says the future of his business
OL,9,Fis "uncertain" after missing out on
OL,10,Fvital funding for environmental work.
OL,12,FPeter Hatley, from Landbeach near
OL,13,FCambridge, was one of thousands of
OL,14,Ffarmers nationwide who lost out when
OL,15,Fthe application window for the #253m
OL,16,FSustainable Farming Incentive (SFI)
OL,17,Fclosed after six hours.
OL,19,FHe said he had prepared thoroughly to
OL,20,Fapply for #150,000 funding and logged
OL,21,Fon to the system as it opened,
OL,22,Fdescribing it as a "total fiasco".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
