OL,3,GNEWSAGrant 'fiasco' leaves future
OL,4,Auncertain, says farmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarming Minister Stephen Morgan said he
OL,7,Fhad listened to concerns and that an
OL,8,Fextra #20m would be added to the fund
OL,9,Fdue to demand.
